# Public template only. Contains no service credentials; never use as a runtime profile.
# Copy to .env.device or .env.production only for a new setup; preserve existing profiles.
# Both profiles must use identical variable names and existing shared service credentials.
# Device: NODE_ENV=development, APP_ENV=development, API_BASE_URL=http://<CURRENT_LAN_IP>:3000.
# Production: NODE_ENV=production, APP_ENV=production, DEPLOYMENT_ENV=production.
# Leave production API_BASE_URL and ingress settings blank until deployment is configured.
# SHARED_PRODUCTION_SERVICES=true permits live resources; local user actions can change live data.
# Backend secrets belong only in private profiles. Never pass this full file to Flutter.
# See docs/development/ENVIRONMENT_CONFIGURATION.md for required values and safe build commands.

